94539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov","html_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":1911,"digest":"sha256:768c66563618ffef6e79b1c7143aa57a7c917f0f5999e9eafb472cf271fe1427","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-09-17T09:21:23Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T09:21:23Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/releases/download/v0.60.1/verification.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/tarball/v0.60.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/zipball/v0.60.1","body":"# v0.60.1 — Team controls stay in view\n\n- Changing text style or size in Team Options keeps the focused control and its focus ring visible. Your paused game stays paused.\n- During Team play, the redundant header makes way for the arena, Pause and both touch pads. It returns when you open a menu. Text, touch targets and the complete board keep their sizes.\n\nThis correction preserves Team movement, checkpoints, replay and input behavior. It covers team display clearance, focused control visibility, the native Team shell and touch control layout. It does not complete P05 or the broader Team encounter programme.\n\nSource: [`822f3290`](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/commit/822f3290787c704a217e7c185d4b8beb7a527e82), tree `88bd680e09210f9bf56ca18465fdb46afb2f1307`; [source PR #81](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/pull/81).\n\nTwo independent hosted runs each passed **5,416 tests across 430 files**, with no failures, cancellations, skips or TODOs. Validation, lint, formatting, native formatting, syntax, production checks and the ordinary build passed. The frozen package inspection verified all **8,484 source files** and **679 distribution files**. The attached qualification and original evidence retain the exact checks and their scope.\n\nThe previous [v0.60.0 release](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/releases/tag/v0.60.0) remains available. Public Pages deployment and affected browser journeys are checked separately after publication; their acceptance is recorded in the delivery register. Physical controller/touch, zoom, complete Team win/rescue and broader phase qualification remain open.\n"}